        "result_content": "The amendment to the bonded warehouse rules lowers the permitted relative humidity ceiling to 55 percent for stored artwork. Operators must file the revised storage plan with the customs authority before 1 March 2027. The amendment does not change the temperature limits that already apply to climate controlled bonded stores.",
