        "intelligence_item_id": "aaaaaaaa-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
        "result_content": "Implementing guidance clarifies that the revised humidity ceiling applies to all climate controlled bonded stores holding fine art consignments. Stores holding other cargo categories remain under the earlier ceiling until the review in 2028. Inspectors will verify humidity logs during routine audits of bonded stores.",
